'''Opulent salvage''' is an item recovered from [[merchant shipwreck]]s via [[shipwreck salvaging]]. Level 87 [[Sailing]] is required to salvage these, granting 200 experience if a player is using the salvaging hook.

[[Crewmates]] commanded to salvage earn a reduced rate at a [[Shipwreck_salvaging#Success_rate|percentage]] dependent on the crew's [[Crew_Management#Deckhandiness|deckhandiness]].

When sorted at a [[salvaging station]] (or the [[Salvaging station (facility)|boat facility]]), players will additionally receive 95 Sailing experience and loot.

As with all salvage, opulent salvage can be stored in your ship's [[Cargo hold]].

