* For a few weeks after its release, whenever "nothing" was rolled on the [[gem drop table]], salvage sorting would be interrupted and a failsafe message {{Mes|You do not have a high enough Sailing level to sort through any more salvage.}} would be displayed. To fix this, the "nothing" drop was replaced by one coin.

